      "updated": 1791518366640,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• WebSocket client (Think useAgentChat) · stream resume\n• chat panel, citations, AI-use notice\n• diff cards, bulk review table, undo button\n• JWT in Sec-WebSocket-Protocol on the upgrade (never in the URL)\n• holds the host bearer token; on token_needed it fetches a fresh\n  one from the host in the background (the user never sees it)\n• reserved: tool.execute_request / _result (host-exec, future)",
      "originalText": "• WebSocket client (Think useAgentChat) · stream resume\n• chat panel, citations, AI-use notice\n• diff cards, bulk review table, undo button\n• JWT in Sec-WebSocket-Protocol on the upgrade (never in the URL)\n• holds the host bearer token; on token_needed it fetches a fresh\n  one from the host in the background (the user never sees it)\n• reserved: tool.execute_request / _result (host-exec, future)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
