      "seed": 295334610,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 869423882,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• agent loop: getModel() · getTools() · getActions() · runTurn()\n• Think Session (DO SQLite) = SOURCE OF TRUTH for the transcript; Neon messages = exported read model\n• authorizeTurn() → permissions from Policy engine · write tools are action() with durable-pause approval\n• action ledger = idempotency on retries · recovery fibers resume after eviction\n• DO alarms: undo-window expiry, approval expiry, auto-close (both windows = platform defaults)\n• caches config snapshot + tool manifest in DO SQLite · after a publish, refreshed at the next turn\n• host bearer token in memory ONLY · missing → token_needed to widget · widget closed → needs_human\n• mints turn_id (ULID) per turn → messages, tool_calls, model_calls\n• BudgetDO (one per company): reserve before every model call, settle after · step / turn /\n  conversation caps checked locally · loop guard\n• image attachments: stored in R2 via files, fed to the model as UNTRUSTED content",
      "originalText": "• agent loop: getModel() · getTools() · getActions() · runTurn()\n• Think Session (DO SQLite) = SOURCE OF TRUTH for the transcript; Neon messages = exported read model\n• authorizeTurn() → permissions from Policy engine · write tools are action() with durable-pause approval\n• action ledger = idempotency on retries · recovery fibers resume after eviction\n• DO alarms: undo-window expiry, approval expiry, auto-close (both windows = platform defaults)\n• caches config snapshot + tool manifest in DO SQLite · after a publish, refreshed at the next turn\n• host bearer token in memory ONLY · missing → token_needed to widget · widget closed → needs_human\n• mints turn_id (ULID) per turn → messages, tool_calls, model_calls\n• BudgetDO (one per company): reserve before every model call, settle after · step / turn /\n  conversation caps checked locally · loop guard\n• image attachments: stored in R2 via files, fed to the model as UNTRUSTED content",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
