      "text": "/widget/*    origin check · JWT in WS subprotocol\n             verified before upgrade → Conversation DO\n             (default bot unless the embed names one)\n/dashboard/* Clerk session\n/operator/*  operator only\n/eval/*      platform-signed eval JWT,\n             staging connections only\nJWKS cached in KV · rate limit\nRLS ctx: set_config(…, true) per transaction\nauthz: one can(admin, action, resource)",
