      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "exposed as tool: search_help_docs\nhybrid: pgvector + tsvector (BM25)\n→ RRF fuse → top 20\n→ rerank (Workers AI via AI Gateway) → top 5\nrerank is per-query, never stored\nchunks fenced as UNTRUSTED\nlow confidence → 'I don't know'",
