      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "task_type → tier → model\nallow-list = providers the company\n  has keys for (no platform keys)\ncompany key: decrypt → auth header\nkey fails → 'temporarily unavailable'\n  + system quality_issue\n5 metadata keys · gateway_log_id\nimages → vision-capable models only\nembed + rerank = tier 4 (Workers AI,\n  the only platform-paid calls)\nevery call → one model_calls row",
      "originalText": "task_type → tier → model\nallow-list = providers the company\n  has keys for (no platform keys)\ncompany key: decrypt → auth header\nkey fails → 'temporarily unavailable'\n  + system quality_issue\n5 metadata keys · gateway_log_id\nimages → vision-capable models only\nembed + rerank = tier 4 (Workers AI,\n  the only platform-paid calls)\nevery call → one model_calls row",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
