      "updated": 1791900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WebCrypto AES-256-GCM\nmaster key (Secrets Store) encrypts\n  one company key per company\ncompany key encrypts the data\nfresh IV per value\ndestroy company key = crypto-shred\n  (encrypted_* columns only)\nplaintext in memory only",
      "originalText": "WebCrypto AES-256-GCM\nmaster key (Secrets Store) encrypts\n  one company key per company\ncompany key encrypts the data\nfresh IV per value\ndestroy company key = crypto-shred\n  (encrypted_* columns only)\nplaintext in memory only",
