      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1203357637,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Queues     outbox events · per-chunk embedding · webhook fan-out\nWorkflows  doc ingestion (fetch → hash → chunk → embed → upsert) · large change-request commits\n           · eval trigger (hands off to the Python harness)\nDO alarms  undo expiry · approval expiry · conversation auto-close (per conversation)\nCron       hourly activity_rollups (idempotent, jittered per company) · daily retention purge\n           · knowledge re-sync · doc-gap clustering · nightly platform evals · budget alerts 50/80/100%\n           · outbox relay sweep · daily production health per bot",
      "originalText": "Queues     outbox events · per-chunk embedding · webhook fan-out\nWorkflows  doc ingestion (fetch → hash → chunk → embed → upsert) · large change-request commits\n           · eval trigger (hands off to the Python harness)\nDO alarms  undo expiry · approval expiry · conversation auto-close (per conversation)\nCron       hourly activity_rollups (idempotent, jittered per company) · daily retention purge\n           · knowledge re-sync · doc-gap clustering · nightly platform evals · budget alerts 50/80/100%\n           · outbox relay sweep · daily production health per bot",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
