      "text": "Shared DB · company_id on every row · RLS\nStorage router: company → connection (dedicated DB later)\npgvector used for: knowledge retrieval · doc-gap clustering\n  · (later) tool-call few-shots\nWritten by: Action service (sync, change_requests + activity_log + event_outbox) · Knowledge (hybrid search)\n  · Activity log writer via Queue · Eval harness (results) · all via the DAL\n8 table groups, 30 tables — see tables and relationships below",
      "originalText": "Shared DB · company_id on every row · RLS\nStorage router: company → connection (dedicated DB later)\npgvector used for: knowledge retrieval · doc-gap clustering\n  · (later) tool-call few-shots\nWritten by: Action service (sync, change_requests + activity_log + event_outbox) · Knowledge (hybrid search)\n  · Activity log writer via Queue · Eval harness (results) · all via the DAL\n8 table groups, 30 tables — see tables and relationships below",
