      "text": "logs · cache · retry + fallback · Dynamic Routes\nspend limits split by company_id\nmetadata: company_id · user_id · task_type ·\n  conversation_id · env (max 5)\nDLP on prompts · Guardrails · Logpush to own storage\nshort log retention (≤ 7 days) + R2 lifecycle on\n  Logpush: gateway logs hold full prompts",
