      "text": "black-box: drives turns over /eval/* on the company's\n  staging connection (platform-signed eval JWT)\nstate-independent cases · reset_op after the run\ngate + manual: customer's test env\nnightly: platform suite on our own test company\n  + daily production health alerts per bot\nruns in GitHub Actions (platform suite)\n  + Containers / Lambda (config-publish gate)\ndeterministic checks + LLM-judged rubrics (pass^k)\nsafety cases = hard gate (any failure fails the run)\njudge pinned in harness code · on the company's key\n  (error if the key can't reach the pinned judge)\n  logged as model_calls eval.judge\nwrites eval_runs / eval_results to Neon\ncase schemas: Zod → JSON Schema → Python types",
      "originalText": "black-box: drives turns over /eval/* on the company's\n  staging connection (platform-signed eval JWT)\nstate-independent cases · reset_op after the run\ngate + manual: customer's test env\nnightly: platform suite on our own test company\n  + daily production health alerts per bot\nruns in GitHub Actions (platform suite)\n  + Containers / Lambda (config-publish gate)\ndeterministic checks + LLM-judged rubrics (pass^k)\nsafety cases = hard gate (any failure fails the run)\njudge pinned in harness code · on the company's key\n  (error if the key can't reach the pinned judge)\n  logged as model_calls eval.judge\nwrites eval_runs / eval_results to Neon\ncase schemas: Zod → JSON Schema → Python types",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
