    },
    {
      "id": "tex-169",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 14,
      "y": 1684.5,
      "width": 1004.64,
      "height": 210.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp-166"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 272167094,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1079447663,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791518366640,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1  widget gets companion JWT from host backend (identity to your platform)\n2  widget opens WebSocket to Edge API · origin check · JWT in subprotocol, verified before the upgrade · iss → company_connections · JWKS from iss (KV)\n3  worker forwards the upgrade → Conversation DO (Think) of the conversation · mints turn_id · config snapshot + tool manifest (refreshed after a publish)\n4  authorizeTurn: JWT roles × approvalRules → granted permissions\n5  persona [trusted] · user text + images + search_help_docs results (top 5 after rerank) [untrusted, fenced]\n6  BudgetDO.reserve → router → tier → company key → AI Gateway (5 metadata keys) → BudgetDO.settle · key fails → 'temporarily unavailable'\n7  write tool → action(): adapter read-before → diff → status proposed → turn parks (durable-pause)\n8  user approves in widget → approveExecution() · no host token → token_needed, widget fetches a fresh one silently\n9  adapter commits AS THE USER via AuthStrategy (jwt_forward for eRegister) + idempotency\n10 read-after → compare → verified | mismatch → auto-undo · undo window set as DO alarm\n11 activity_log + event_outbox in the same transaction → relay → Queue · low-stakes telemetry via waitUntil\n   Transcript lives in Think Session; exported to Neon messages on onChatResponse",
      "originalText": "1  widget gets companion JWT from host backend (identity to your platform)\n2  widget opens WebSocket to Edge API · origin check · JWT in subprotocol, verified before the upgrade · iss → company_connections · JWKS from iss (KV)\n3  worker forwards the upgrade → Conversation DO (Think) of the conversation · mints turn_id · config snapshot + tool manifest (refreshed after a publish)\n4  authorizeTurn: JWT roles × approvalRules → granted permissions\n5  persona [trusted] · user text + images + search_help_docs results (top 5 after rerank) [untrusted, fenced]\n6  BudgetDO.reserve → router → tier → company key → AI Gateway (5 metadata keys) → BudgetDO.settle · key fails → 'temporarily unavailable'\n7  write tool → action(): adapter read-before → diff → status proposed → turn parks (durable-pause)\n8  user approves in widget → approveExecution() · no host token → token_needed, widget fetches a fresh one silently\n9  adapter commits AS THE USER via AuthStrategy (jwt_forward for eRegister) + idempotency\n10 read-after → compare → verified | mismatch → auto-undo · undo window set as DO alarm\n11 activity_log + event_outbox in the same transaction → relay → Queue · low-stakes telemetry via waitUntil\n   Transcript lives in Think Session; exported to Neon messages on onChatResponse",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
