      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What changed v0.1 → v0.14 (names as of v0.14; old → new where renamed)",
      "originalText": "What changed v0.1 → v0.14 (names as of v0.14; old → new where renamed)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "tex-189",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1754,
      "y": 1684.5,
      "width": 939.12,
      "height": 437.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp-186"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 693491441,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1853372069,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790600000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Harness: Think. Session owns the transcript; Neon messages is a read model; approvals via action() + durable-pause\n• AI gateway box renamed Model router; caching, fallback, metering and spend limits handled by Cloudflare AI Gateway\n• Change flow: read-before → diff → approve (fresh host token) → commit → read-after → auto-undo on mismatch\n• Adapter + AuthStrategy interfaces; v1 = REST + jwt_forward; host-exec, MCP and other auth types designed as future\n• Encryption: master key (Secrets Store) encrypts one company key per company (company_encryption_keys);\n  the company key encrypts company_secrets, chatbot_user_secrets, tool args and change payloads\n• BYOK from day one: company_secrets (type = model_key); router allow-list driven by which keys a company has\n• Knowledge: retrieval is a tool the model calls; hybrid vector + BM25; rerank per query, never stored\n• Cost and prompt-injection guardrails: see the box on the right · image attachments are untrusted, vision models only\n• Async split into Queues / Workflows / DO alarms / Cron · Evals: Python + DeepEval, black-box, mock host\n• No database foreign keys anywhere: references are enforced in the Repo layer\n• Table renames: tenants → companies · dashboard_users + tenant_members → admins · end_users → chatbot_users\n  host_connections → company_connections · actions + action_changes → agent_change_requests · baselines → roi_assumptions\n  review_flags → quality_issues · events + audit_entries → activity_log · daily_metrics → activity_rollups\n  company_data_keys → company_encryption_keys · chatbot_user_credentials → chatbot_user_secrets\n• Tables dropped: config_templates · extraction_batches + extraction_rows (host owns parsing) · knowledge_documents (now files)\n• Column renames: every *kind → *type · dek_wrapped → encrypted_key · kek_id → master_key_version\n  dek_version → encryption_key_version · args_enc → encrypted_args · changes_enc → encrypted_changes · key_hint → last_four_chars\n  writes_enabled → read_only (meaning flipped: true = agent can only read) · monthly_budget_micros → spending_budget\n  every *_micros money column → *_usd numeric(12,6) (cost_micros → cost_usd, hourly_cost_micros → hourly_cost_usd)\n  active_config_version_id → active_config_id · chatbot_users.deleted_at → erased_at\n• Columns dropped: retain_until (derived) · started_at · first_seen_at · messages.redacted · last_error · proposal jsonb\n  companies: slug · plan · region · storage_route · admins: public_id · role (derived from company_id)\n  chatbot_users: public_id · locale · last_seen_at (added created_at, updated_at)\n• Result: 27 tables in 8 groups",
      "originalText": "• Harness: Think. Session owns the transcript; Neon messages is a read model; approvals via action() + durable-pause\n• AI gateway box renamed Model router; caching, fallback, metering and spend limits handled by Cloudflare AI Gateway\n• Change flow: read-before → diff → approve (fresh host token) → commit → read-after → auto-undo on mismatch\n• Adapter + AuthStrategy interfaces; v1 = REST + jwt_forward; host-exec, MCP and other auth types designed as future\n• Encryption: master key (Secrets Store) encrypts one company key per company (company_encryption_keys);\n  the company key encrypts company_secrets, chatbot_user_secrets, tool args and change payloads\n• BYOK from day one: company_secrets (type = model_key); router allow-list driven by which keys a company has\n• Knowledge: retrieval is a tool the model calls; hybrid vector + BM25; rerank per query, never stored\n• Cost and prompt-injection guardrails: see the box on the right · image attachments are untrusted, vision models only\n• Async split into Queues / Workflows / DO alarms / Cron · Evals: Python + DeepEval, black-box, mock host\n• No database foreign keys anywhere: references are enforced in the Repo layer\n• Table renames: tenants → companies · dashboard_users + tenant_members → admins · end_users → chatbot_users\n  host_connections → company_connections · actions + action_changes → agent_change_requests · baselines → roi_assumptions\n  review_flags → quality_issues · events + audit_entries → activity_log · daily_metrics → activity_rollups\n  company_data_keys → company_encryption_keys · chatbot_user_credentials → chatbot_user_secrets\n• Tables dropped: config_templates · extraction_batches + extraction_rows (host owns parsing) · knowledge_documents (now files)\n• Column renames: every *kind → *type · dek_wrapped → encrypted_key · kek_id → master_key_version\n  dek_version → encryption_key_version · args_enc → encrypted_args · changes_enc → encrypted_changes · key_hint → last_four_chars\n  writes_enabled → read_only (meaning flipped: true = agent can only read) · monthly_budget_micros → spending_budget\n  every *_micros money column → *_usd numeric(12,6) (cost_micros → cost_usd, hourly_cost_micros → hourly_cost_usd)\n  active_config_version_id → active_config_id · chatbot_users.deleted_at → erased_at\n• Columns dropped: retain_until (derived) · started_at · first_seen_at · messages.redacted · last_error · proposal jsonb\n  companies: slug · plan · region · storage_route · admins: public_id · role (derived from company_id)\n  chatbot_users: public_id · locale · last_seen_at (added created_at, updated_at)\n• Result: 27 tables in 8 groups",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
