      "updated": 1790600000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Guardrails: cost spikes and prompt injection",
      "originalText": "Guardrails: cost spikes and prompt injection",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "tex-193",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3434,
      "y": 1684.5,
      "width": 797.6800000000001,
      "height": 227.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp-190"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1531648886,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1338915973,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "COST: every limit is checked BEFORE the next model call (nightly reconciliation is accounting only)\n  step: max model steps + tool calls per turn · same tool + same args twice → stop\n  turn: max tokens · wall-clock timeout · cost ceiling\n  conversation: turns per hour · cost cap      chatbot user: messages/min · daily cost cap\n  company: spending_budget (per billing period) · alerts 50/80/100% · AI Gateway spend + rate limits (second wall)\n  platform: global circuit breaker · sub-agents share the parent turn budget (depth limit)\n  retries bounded + idempotent · eval cost counts toward spending_budget · live counters in BudgetDO (one per company)\nINJECTION: limit the blast radius, it cannot be fully prevented\n  agent acts AS the user · never exceeds the user's own host permissions\n  provenance: persona/config trusted · user text, docs, tool output, images untrusted + fenced\n  untrusted content in the turn → every write needs approval, destructive tools off\n  approval diff built from read-before + real payload, never from the model's summary\n  no exfiltration: no arbitrary URL fetch · no external images in widget · link allow-list\n  AI Gateway Guardrails + DLP · injection cases in is_safety evals gate publish · is_read_only kill switch",
      "originalText": "COST: every limit is checked BEFORE the next model call (nightly reconciliation is accounting only)\n  step: max model steps + tool calls per turn · same tool + same args twice → stop\n  turn: max tokens · wall-clock timeout · cost ceiling\n  conversation: turns per hour · cost cap      chatbot user: messages/min · daily cost cap\n  company: spending_budget (per billing period) · alerts 50/80/100% · AI Gateway spend + rate limits (second wall)\n  platform: global circuit breaker · sub-agents share the parent turn budget (depth limit)\n  retries bounded + idempotent · eval cost counts toward spending_budget · live counters in BudgetDO (one per company)\nINJECTION: limit the blast radius, it cannot be fully prevented\n  agent acts AS the user · never exceeds the user's own host permissions\n  provenance: persona/config trusted · user text, docs, tool output, images untrusted + fenced\n  untrusted content in the turn → every write needs approval, destructive tools off\n  approval diff built from read-before + real payload, never from the model's summary\n  no exfiltration: no arbitrary URL fetch · no external images in widget · link allow-list\n  AI Gateway Guardrails + DLP · injection cases in is_safety evals gate publish · is_read_only kill switch",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
