      "text": "*id                    bigint PK\n*company_id            bigint → companies\n*version               int\n*encrypted_key         bytea (company key, encrypted by\n                       the master key)\n*master_key_version    int (which master key encrypted it)\n*status                smallint active/retiring/destroyed\n                       (retiring only during rotation)\n*created_at            timestamptz NN\n*destroyed_at          timestamptz (crypto-shred)\n*public_id             text UQ\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN\n*UQ (company_id, version)\n*UQ (company_id) WHERE status = active\n*rotation: new active → re-encrypt → destroy old\n*encrypted_key nulled on destroy = crypto-shred",
      "originalText": "*id                    bigint PK\n*company_id            bigint → companies\n*version               int\n*encrypted_key         bytea (company key, encrypted by\n                       the master key)\n*master_key_version    int (which master key encrypted it)\n*status                smallint active/retiring/destroyed\n                       (retiring only during rotation)\n*created_at            timestamptz NN\n*destroyed_at          timestamptz (crypto-shred)\n*public_id             text UQ\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN\n*UQ (company_id, version)\n*UQ (company_id) WHERE status = active\n*rotation: new active → re-encrypt → destroy old\n*encrypted_key nulled on destroy = crypto-shred",
