      "text": "*id                    bigint PK\n*public_id             text UQ\n*company_id            bigint → companies\n*type                  smallint 1 model_key 2 api_key\n                       3 client_secret 4 hmac_key\n*provider              text google/openai/anthropic\n                       (model_key only)\n*connection_id         bigint → company_connections null\n*encrypted_secret      bytea\n*iv                    bytea (new on every write)\n*encryption_key_version int (which company key)\n*last_four_chars       text\n*status                smallint 1 active 2 invalid 3 revoked\n*expires_at            timestamptz\n*last_validated_at     timestamptz\n*rotated_at            timestamptz (admin replaced value)\n*created_by            bigint → admins null\n*updated_by            bigint → admins null (rotation)\n*created_at            timestamptz NN\n*updated_at            timestamptz\n*CHECK type = model_key ⇔ provider NOT NULL\n*CHECK type ≠ model_key ⇔ connection_id NOT NULL\n*UQ (company_id, provider) WHERE type = model_key\n   AND status = active\n*UQ (company_id, connection_id, type) WHERE\n   type ≠ model_key AND status = active\n*rotation overwrites the row: validate first\n*model_key required: no platform keys, publish blocked\n*  without one · staging connection: test-user host\n*  credential for evals\n*(was company_model_keys + company_credentials)",
      "originalText": "*id                    bigint PK\n*public_id             text UQ\n*company_id            bigint → companies\n*type                  smallint 1 model_key 2 api_key\n                       3 client_secret 4 hmac_key\n*provider              text google/openai/anthropic\n                       (model_key only)\n*connection_id         bigint → company_connections null\n*encrypted_secret      bytea\n*iv                    bytea (new on every write)\n*encryption_key_version int (which company key)\n*last_four_chars       text\n*status                smallint 1 active 2 invalid 3 revoked\n*expires_at            timestamptz\n*last_validated_at     timestamptz\n*rotated_at            timestamptz (admin replaced value)\n*created_by            bigint → admins null\n*updated_by            bigint → admins null (rotation)\n*created_at            timestamptz NN\n*updated_at            timestamptz\n*CHECK type = model_key ⇔ provider NOT NULL\n*CHECK type ≠ model_key ⇔ connection_id NOT NULL\n*UQ (company_id, provider) WHERE type = model_key\n   AND status = active\n*UQ (company_id, connection_id, type) WHERE\n   type ≠ model_key AND status = active\n*rotation overwrites the row: validate first\n*model_key required: no platform keys, publish blocked\n*  without one · staging connection: test-user host\n*  credential for evals\n*(was company_model_keys + company_credentials)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
