      "text": "*id                    bigint PK\n*company_id            bigint → companies\n*chatbot_user_id       bigint → chatbot_users\n*connection_id         bigint → company_connections\n*type                  text (= the connection's auth_type)\n*encrypted_secret      bytea (JSON; shape set by that\n                       AuthStrategy, e.g. refresh token)\n*iv                    bytea\n*encryption_key_version int\n*scopes                text[] null\n*expires_at            timestamptz null (renew / re-ask)\n*status                smallint 1 active 2 needs_reauth\n                       3 revoked\n*created_at            timestamptz NN\n*updated_at            timestamptz\n*public_id             text UQ\n*UQ (chatbot_user_id, connection_id)\n*deleted when the chatbot_user is erased",
      "originalText": "*id                    bigint PK\n*company_id            bigint → companies\n*chatbot_user_id       bigint → chatbot_users\n*connection_id         bigint → company_connections\n*type                  text (= the connection's auth_type)\n*encrypted_secret      bytea (JSON; shape set by that\n                       AuthStrategy, e.g. refresh token)\n*iv                    bytea\n*encryption_key_version int\n*scopes                text[] null\n*expires_at            timestamptz null (renew / re-ask)\n*status                smallint 1 active 2 needs_reauth\n                       3 revoked\n*created_at            timestamptz NN\n*updated_at            timestamptz\n*public_id             text UQ\n*UQ (chatbot_user_id, connection_id)\n*deleted when the chatbot_user is erased",
