      "text": "id                     bigint PK\npublic_id              text UQ\nname                   text NN\nstatus                 smallint 1 active 2 paused 3 churned\n*is_read_only          bool default false\n                       (true = agent can only read)\n*spending_budget       numeric(12,6) USD per billing\n                       period, admin-editable\n*content_retention_days int (chat content kept this long\n                       after last_activity_at)\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN\nupdated_at             timestamptz\n*updated_by            bigint → admins null",
