      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "id                     bigint PK\npublic_id              text UQ\ncompany_id             bigint → companies\n*environment           smallint 1 production 2 staging\nadapter_type           smallint 1 rest\n                       *2 host_exec (future) 3 mcp (future)\n*base_url              text null (null only for host_exec)\n*auth_type             text jwt_forward | api_key_header |\n                       oauth2_cc | oauth2_authcode | hmac_signed\n*auth_config           jsonb (Zod schema per AuthStrategy)\n*credential_scope      smallint 1 none 2 company 3 chatbot_user\n*jwt_issuer            text NN UQ (companion JWT iss;\n                       lookup key: token iss → this row)\n*allowed_origins       text[] NN (widget WebSocket Origin)\n*reset_op              jsonb null {method, path} (staging:\n                       eval cleanup after a run)\n*status                smallint 1 active 2 disabled\n*created_by            bigint → admins null\n*updated_by            bigint → admins null\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN\nupdated_at             timestamptz\n*JWKS derived from issuer: {iss}/.well-known/jwks.json\n*  (cached in KV) · aud = platform constant, not stored\n*UQ jwt_issuer → one issuer per environment\n*(was host_connections; secret_ref, jwks_url,\n*  jwt_audience removed)\n*staging row: gate evals run here (eval JWT only)",
      "originalText": "id                     bigint PK\npublic_id              text UQ\ncompany_id             bigint → companies\n*environment           smallint 1 production 2 staging\nadapter_type           smallint 1 rest\n                       *2 host_exec (future) 3 mcp (future)\n*base_url              text null (null only for host_exec)\n*auth_type             text jwt_forward | api_key_header |\n                       oauth2_cc | oauth2_authcode | hmac_signed\n*auth_config           jsonb (Zod schema per AuthStrategy)\n*credential_scope      smallint 1 none 2 company 3 chatbot_user\n*jwt_issuer            text NN UQ (companion JWT iss;\n                       lookup key: token iss → this row)\n*allowed_origins       text[] NN (widget WebSocket Origin)\n*reset_op              jsonb null {method, path} (staging:\n                       eval cleanup after a run)\n*status                smallint 1 active 2 disabled\n*created_by            bigint → admins null\n*updated_by            bigint → admins null\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN\nupdated_at             timestamptz\n*JWKS derived from issuer: {iss}/.well-known/jwks.json\n*  (cached in KV) · aud = platform constant, not stored\n*UQ jwt_issuer → one issuer per environment\n*(was host_connections; secret_ref, jwks_url,\n*  jwt_audience removed)\n*staging row: gate evals run here (eval JWT only)",
