      "text": "id                     bigint PK\npublic_id              text UQ\ncompany_id             bigint → companies\n*chatbot_id            bigint NN → chatbots\n*config_version        int NN (was version_no)\n*schema_version        smallint NN default 1 (body format:\n                       which Zod spec in code parses body)\nstatus                 smallint 1 draft 2 testing\n                       3 ready 4 published 5 archived\nbody                   jsonb NN (Zod-validated:\n                       persona, procedures,\n                       tools[{name, version}],\n                       approvalRules, routing,\n                       knowledge, widget, limits,\n                       attachments)\nbody_hash              text NN\n*approved_by_run_id    bigint → eval_runs null UQ (the gate\n                       run: trigger = gate AND has_passed)\n*created_by            bigint → admins null (null = system)\n*updated_by            bigint → admins null\n*published_by          bigint → admins null\npublished_at           timestamptz\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN default now()\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN default now()\n*UQ (chatbot_id, config_version)\n*UQ (chatbot_id) WHERE status = published\n*body editable only while status = draft (Repo layer)\n*rollback = copy old body → new draft → gate → publish",
      "originalText": "id                     bigint PK\npublic_id              text UQ\ncompany_id             bigint → companies\n*chatbot_id            bigint NN → chatbots\n*config_version        int NN (was version_no)\n*schema_version        smallint NN default 1 (body format:\n                       which Zod spec in code parses body)\nstatus                 smallint 1 draft 2 testing\n                       3 ready 4 published 5 archived\nbody                   jsonb NN (Zod-validated:\n                       persona, procedures,\n                       tools[{name, version}],\n                       approvalRules, routing,\n                       knowledge, widget, limits,\n                       attachments)\nbody_hash              text NN\n*approved_by_run_id    bigint → eval_runs null UQ (the gate\n                       run: trigger = gate AND has_passed)\n*created_by            bigint → admins null (null = system)\n*updated_by            bigint → admins null\n*published_by          bigint → admins null\npublished_at           timestamptz\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN default now()\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN default now()\n*UQ (chatbot_id, config_version)\n*UQ (chatbot_id) WHERE status = published\n*body editable only while status = draft (Repo layer)\n*rollback = copy old body → new draft → gate → publish",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
