      "text": "*id                    bigint PK\n*public_id             text UQ\n*company_id            bigint → companies\n*connection_id         bigint → company_connections\n*name                  text\n*version               int\n*description           text (shown to the model)\n*risk                  smallint read/write/destructive\n*input_schema          jsonb\n*call_op               jsonb {method, path, body_map}\n                       (every tool; reads too)\n*readback_op           jsonb null {method, path, compare}\n                       (writes only: read-before + read-after)\n*inverse_op            jsonb null (null = not undoable)\n*idempotency_mode      smallint native/emulated/none\n*approval              smallint always/policy/never\n*source                smallint openapi/manual\n*status                smallint draft/active/disabled\n*created_by            bigint → admins null\n*updated_by            bigint → admins null\n*created_at            timestamptz NN\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN\n*UQ (company_id, name, version)\n*CHECK risk = read ⇔ readback_op IS NULL\n*placeholders: {args.*} {before.*} {result.*}\n*compare keys = arg names (expected = args[key])\n*(was tools; write_op → call_op; diff_fields → readback_op.compare)",
      "originalText": "*id                    bigint PK\n*public_id             text UQ\n*company_id            bigint → companies\n*connection_id         bigint → company_connections\n*name                  text\n*version               int\n*description           text (shown to the model)\n*risk                  smallint read/write/destructive\n*input_schema          jsonb\n*call_op               jsonb {method, path, body_map}\n                       (every tool; reads too)\n*readback_op           jsonb null {method, path, compare}\n                       (writes only: read-before + read-after)\n*inverse_op            jsonb null (null = not undoable)\n*idempotency_mode      smallint native/emulated/none\n*approval              smallint always/policy/never\n*source                smallint openapi/manual\n*status                smallint draft/active/disabled\n*created_by            bigint → admins null\n*updated_by            bigint → admins null\n*created_at            timestamptz NN\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN\n*UQ (company_id, name, version)\n*CHECK risk = read ⇔ readback_op IS NULL\n*placeholders: {args.*} {before.*} {result.*}\n*compare keys = arg names (expected = args[key])\n*(was tools; write_op → call_op; diff_fields → readback_op.compare)",
      "fontSize": 13,
