      "text": "id                     bigint PK\npublic_id              text UQ\ncompany_id             bigint → companies\n*chatbot_config_id     bigint NN → chatbot_configs\n*trigger               smallint NN 1 gate 2 manual 3 nightly\n*harness_version       text NN (git sha; also pins pass\n                       threshold, judge model, safety rule)\nk                      smallint NN (attempts per case;\n                       a case passes only if all k pass)\n*status                smallint NN 1 queued 2 running\n                       3 done 4 failed\ncase_count             int null (set when done)\npass_all_k_count       int null (set when done)\n*has_passed            bool null (null until done)\n*cost_usd              numeric(12,6) NN default 0\n                       (bot + judge calls, see model_calls)\n*created_at            timestamptz NN default now()\nfinished_at            timestamptz null\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN\n*gate = trigger gate AND has_passed",
      "originalText": "id                     bigint PK\npublic_id              text UQ\ncompany_id             bigint → companies\n*chatbot_config_id     bigint NN → chatbot_configs\n*trigger               smallint NN 1 gate 2 manual 3 nightly\n*harness_version       text NN (git sha; also pins pass\n                       threshold, judge model, safety rule)\nk                      smallint NN (attempts per case;\n                       a case passes only if all k pass)\n*status                smallint NN 1 queued 2 running\n                       3 done 4 failed\ncase_count             int null (set when done)\npass_all_k_count       int null (set when done)\n*has_passed            bool null (null until done)\n*cost_usd              numeric(12,6) NN default 0\n                       (bot + judge calls, see model_calls)\n*created_at            timestamptz NN default now()\nfinished_at            timestamptz null\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN\n*gate = trigger gate AND has_passed",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
