      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "id                     bigint PK\npublic_id              text UQ\ncompany_id             bigint null (null=platform;\n                       *RLS policy states NULL case)\n*chatbot_id            bigint → chatbots (NN except\n                       platform cases)\nname                   text\ninput                  jsonb (messages; no fixture)\nexpectations           jsonb (readback asserts, tool calls,\n                       rubric, forbidden tools)\nis_safety              bool\n*is_active             bool\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN\nupdated_at             timestamptz\n*origin: company_id null = platform, else customer\n*from an issue: link lives on quality_issues.eval_case_id\n*convert from issue: chat text rewritten without PII,\n*  admin confirms before save (must survive chat purge)\n*is_safety: any safety case failing = run fails\n*  (hard gate, even above the pass threshold)\n*platform safety cases can't be set is_active = false\n*safety results shown separately in the dashboard\n*state-independent: each case creates uniquely named\n*  records, asserts only on those · reset_op after the run\n*readback asserts use the same path as live verification",
      "originalText": "id                     bigint PK\npublic_id              text UQ\ncompany_id             bigint null (null=platform;\n                       *RLS policy states NULL case)\n*chatbot_id            bigint → chatbots (NN except\n                       platform cases)\nname                   text\ninput                  jsonb (messages; no fixture)\nexpectations           jsonb (readback asserts, tool calls,\n                       rubric, forbidden tools)\nis_safety              bool\n*is_active             bool\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN\nupdated_at             timestamptz\n*origin: company_id null = platform, else customer\n*from an issue: link lives on quality_issues.eval_case_id\n*convert from issue: chat text rewritten without PII,\n*  admin confirms before save (must survive chat purge)\n*is_safety: any safety case failing = run fails\n*  (hard gate, even above the pass threshold)\n*platform safety cases can't be set is_active = false\n*safety results shown separately in the dashboard\n*state-independent: each case creates uniquely named\n*  records, asserts only on those · reset_op after the run\n*readback asserts use the same path as live verification",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
