      "text": "*id                    bigint PK\n*company_id            bigint → companies\n*conversation_id       bigint → conversations\n*change_request_id     bigint → change_requests null\n*feedback_id           bigint → feedback null (source = user)\n*source                smallint NN 1 user 2 admin 3 system\n*status                smallint NN 1 open 2 dismissed\n                       3 converted 4 fixed\n*issue_type            smallint null knowledge_gap/\n                       missing_tool/tool_bug/\n                       model_error/injection\n                       (null until admin triage)\n*note                  text\n*eval_case_id          bigint → eval_cases null UQ\n                       (became a test)\n*created_by            bigint → admins null (source = admin)\n*updated_by            bigint → admins null (triage)\n*created_at            timestamptz NN\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN\n*public_id             text UQ\n*CHECK source = user ⇔ feedback_id NOT NULL\n*CHECK source = admin ⇔ created_by NOT NULL\n*inbox: user thumbs-down, admin flag, system detection\n*CHECK status = converted ⇔ eval_case_id NOT NULL",
      "originalText": "*id                    bigint PK\n*company_id            bigint → companies\n*conversation_id       bigint → conversations\n*change_request_id     bigint → change_requests null\n*feedback_id           bigint → feedback null (source = user)\n*source                smallint NN 1 user 2 admin 3 system\n*status                smallint NN 1 open 2 dismissed\n                       3 converted 4 fixed\n*issue_type            smallint null knowledge_gap/\n                       missing_tool/tool_bug/\n                       model_error/injection\n                       (null until admin triage)\n*note                  text\n*eval_case_id          bigint → eval_cases null UQ\n                       (became a test)\n*created_by            bigint → admins null (source = admin)\n*updated_by            bigint → admins null (triage)\n*created_at            timestamptz NN\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN\n*public_id             text UQ\n*CHECK source = user ⇔ feedback_id NOT NULL\n*CHECK source = admin ⇔ created_by NOT NULL\n*inbox: user thumbs-down, admin flag, system detection\n*CHECK status = converted ⇔ eval_case_id NOT NULL",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
