      "text": "id                     bigint PK\npublic_id              text UQ (= Think DO name)\ncompany_id             bigint → companies\nchatbot_user_id        bigint → chatbot_users\n*chatbot_id            bigint NN → chatbots\n*chatbot_config_id     bigint → chatbot_configs (current;\n                       refreshed at the next turn)\nstatus                 smallint open/closed\noutcome                smallint answered/action_done/\n                       idk/handoff/abandoned\ntitle                  text\nlast_activity_at       timestamptz\n*root_log_id          bigint (→ activity_log tree)\n*content_purged_at      timestamptz (whole chat; expiry is\n                       derived from last_activity_at +\n                       companies.content_retention_days)\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN\nupdated_at             timestamptz",
      "originalText": "id                     bigint PK\npublic_id              text UQ (= Think DO name)\ncompany_id             bigint → companies\nchatbot_user_id        bigint → chatbot_users\n*chatbot_id            bigint NN → chatbots\n*chatbot_config_id     bigint → chatbot_configs (current;\n                       refreshed at the next turn)\nstatus                 smallint open/closed\noutcome                smallint answered/action_done/\n                       idk/handoff/abandoned\ntitle                  text\nlast_activity_at       timestamptz\n*root_log_id          bigint (→ activity_log tree)\n*content_purged_at      timestamptz (whole chat; expiry is\n                       derived from last_activity_at +\n                       companies.content_retention_days)\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN\nupdated_at             timestamptz",
