      "text": "id                     bigint PK\npublic_id              text UQ\ncompany_id             bigint → companies\nconversation_id        bigint → conversations\n*session_message_id    text (Think message id; UQ per conversation)\n*turn_id               text NN (ULID; user + reply share it)\nrole                   smallint user/assistant/tool\ncontent                jsonb (text, citations[],\n                       *attachment file ids)\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN\n*written on onChatResponse; never read into a turn\n*truth for live chats = Think session;\n*this is the read model. Purge hits both.",
