      "text": "id                     bigint PK\ncompany_id             bigint → companies\n*chatbot_id            bigint → chatbots null\n*chatbot_user_id       bigint → chatbot_users null\nconversation_id        bigint → conversations null\neval_run_id            bigint → eval_runs null\n*turn_id               text null (ULID from Conversation DO)\n*task_type             text (route.intent, qa.answer…,\n                       eval.judge = grader call,\n                       knowledge.embed, search.embed,\n                       search.rerank, doc_gap.embed)\n*tier                  smallint 1 small 2 mid 3 top\n                       4 embed (embed + rerank)\nprovider               text (or workers_ai: embed)\nmodel                  text\n*gateway_log_id        text (AI Gateway log)\ninput_tokens           int\n*output_tokens         int null (none for embed/rerank)\ncached_tokens          int\n*cost_usd              numeric(12,6)\nlatency_ms             int\n*was_escalated         bool\nerror_code             text\n*usage_status          smallint 1 reported 2 pending\n                       3 backfilled 4 unknown 5 estimated\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN\n*public_id             text UQ\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN\n*every model call (chat, judge, embed, rerank) goes via\n*  AI Gateway → one row here = source of truth for spend\n*conversation_id + eval_run_id both null = background\n*  job (indexing, clustering)\n*every call on the company's key, except tier 4\n*  (Workers AI embed / rerank = the only platform cost)",
      "originalText": "id                     bigint PK\ncompany_id             bigint → companies\n*chatbot_id            bigint → chatbots null\n*chatbot_user_id       bigint → chatbot_users null\nconversation_id        bigint → conversations null\neval_run_id            bigint → eval_runs null\n*turn_id               text null (ULID from Conversation DO)\n*task_type             text (route.intent, qa.answer…,\n                       eval.judge = grader call,\n                       knowledge.embed, search.embed,\n                       search.rerank, doc_gap.embed)\n*tier                  smallint 1 small 2 mid 3 top\n                       4 embed (embed + rerank)\nprovider               text (or workers_ai: embed)\nmodel                  text\n*gateway_log_id        text (AI Gateway log)\ninput_tokens           int\n*output_tokens         int null (none for embed/rerank)\ncached_tokens          int\n*cost_usd              numeric(12,6)\nlatency_ms             int\n*was_escalated         bool\nerror_code             text\n*usage_status          smallint 1 reported 2 pending\n                       3 backfilled 4 unknown 5 estimated\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN\n*public_id             text UQ\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN\n*every model call (chat, judge, embed, rerank) goes via\n*  AI Gateway → one row here = source of truth for spend\n*conversation_id + eval_run_id both null = background\n*  job (indexing, clustering)\n*every call on the company's key, except tier 4\n*  (Workers AI embed / rerank = the only platform cost)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
