      "text": "id                     bigint PK\npublic_id              text UQ\ncompany_id             bigint → companies\nconversation_id        bigint → conversations\ntool_call_id           bigint → tool_calls UQ\nstatus                 smallint 1 proposed 2 approved\n                       3 rejected 4 committing 5 committed\n                       6 verified 7 mismatch 8 failed\n                       9 undone 10 expired *11 needs_human\n                       (all-or-nothing: any failure\n                       auto-undoes applied changes)\n*encrypted_changes     bytea (AES-GCM: array of changes\n                       {record ref, field, before, after,\n                       readback, matched, inverse_op},\n                       the diff shown, user edits)\n*iv                    bytea\n*encryption_key_version int\n*summary               text (no values, for lists)\n*change_count          int\nwas_edited             bool\n*think_execution_id    text (durable-pause id)\nidempotency_key        text\nhost_ref               text (id returned by host)\nundo_until             timestamptz\nerror_code             text\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN\nupdated_at             timestamptz\n*tool, version, risk, idempotency_mode: via tool_call_id\n*  → tool_calls → tool_definitions (versions immutable)\n*timeline (approved / committed / verified / undone)\n*  lives in activity_log · approver = the conversation's\n*  chatbot user · purged = encrypted_changes IS NULL\n*  (purge job: undo_until < now() AND NOT NULL)",
      "originalText": "id                     bigint PK\npublic_id              text UQ\ncompany_id             bigint → companies\nconversation_id        bigint → conversations\ntool_call_id           bigint → tool_calls UQ\nstatus                 smallint 1 proposed 2 approved\n                       3 rejected 4 committing 5 committed\n                       6 verified 7 mismatch 8 failed\n                       9 undone 10 expired *11 needs_human\n                       (all-or-nothing: any failure\n                       auto-undoes applied changes)\n*encrypted_changes     bytea (AES-GCM: array of changes\n                       {record ref, field, before, after,\n                       readback, matched, inverse_op},\n                       the diff shown, user edits)\n*iv                    bytea\n*encryption_key_version int\n*summary               text (no values, for lists)\n*change_count          int\nwas_edited             bool\n*think_execution_id    text (durable-pause id)\nidempotency_key        text\nhost_ref               text (id returned by host)\nundo_until             timestamptz\nerror_code             text\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN\nupdated_at             timestamptz\n*tool, version, risk, idempotency_mode: via tool_call_id\n*  → tool_calls → tool_definitions (versions immutable)\n*timeline (approved / committed / verified / undone)\n*  lives in activity_log · approver = the conversation's\n*  chatbot user · purged = encrypted_changes IS NULL\n*  (purge job: undo_until < now() AND NOT NULL)",
      "fontSize": 13,
