      "text": "id                     bigint PK\npublic_id              text UQ\ncompany_id             bigint → companies\n*type                  smallint NN 1 sitemap 2 url 3 upload\n*url                   text null (sitemap / url only)\n*sync_frequency        smallint null 1 manual 2 daily\n                       3 weekly (web only)\n*status                smallint NN 1 active 2 syncing\n                       3 failed 4 paused\nlast_synced_at         timestamptz null\n*sync_run_id           text null (sync run that owns it)\n*sync_heartbeat_at     timestamptz null (stale → re-claim)\n*created_by            bigint → admins null\n*updated_by            bigint → admins null\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN\n*CHECK type IN (sitemap, url) ⇔ url NOT NULL\n*CHECK type IN (sitemap, url) ⇔ sync_frequency NOT NULL\n*doc count = COUNT(files WHERE knowledge_source_id)\n*(uri → url · schedule → sync_frequency · page_count and\n*  team_answers dropped)",
      "originalText": "id                     bigint PK\npublic_id              text UQ\ncompany_id             bigint → companies\n*type                  smallint NN 1 sitemap 2 url 3 upload\n*url                   text null (sitemap / url only)\n*sync_frequency        smallint null 1 manual 2 daily\n                       3 weekly (web only)\n*status                smallint NN 1 active 2 syncing\n                       3 failed 4 paused\nlast_synced_at         timestamptz null\n*sync_run_id           text null (sync run that owns it)\n*sync_heartbeat_at     timestamptz null (stale → re-claim)\n*created_by            bigint → admins null\n*updated_by            bigint → admins null\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN\n*CHECK type IN (sitemap, url) ⇔ url NOT NULL\n*CHECK type IN (sitemap, url) ⇔ sync_frequency NOT NULL\n*doc count = COUNT(files WHERE knowledge_source_id)\n*(uri → url · schedule → sync_frequency · page_count and\n*  team_answers dropped)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
