      "text": "id                     bigint PK\npublic_id              text UQ\ncompany_id             bigint → companies\n*owner_type            text (conversation, eval_run,\n                       knowledge_document…)\n*owner_id              bigint\nfilename               text\nmime                   text\nsize_bytes             bigint\nsha256                 text (bytes: integrity + dedupe)\n*created_by            bigint → admins null (null = system\n                       or the conversation's chatbot user)\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN\n*R2 key = t/{company public_id}/{file public_id}\n*purpose derived from owner_type\n*purged with its owner: R2 object + row\n*(purpose, r2_key, created_by_type/_id, cite_count dropped;\n*  knowledge columns → knowledge_documents)",
