      "text": "id                     bigint PK\ncompany_id             bigint → companies\n*knowledge_document_id bigint → knowledge_documents\n*knowledge_source_id   bigint → knowledge_sources\n                       (copied, for the search filter)\nchunk_index            int\n*heading_path          text (prepended before embedding)\ntext                   text\nembedding              *halfvec(1024)\nembedding_model        text (never mix models in a search)\n*tsv                   tsvector GENERATED (BM25 side)\ncreated_at             timestamptz NN\nHNSW index on embedding · *GIN on tsv\n*pgvector 0.8 iterative scan (tenant filter recall)\n*big tenants: own partition later",
