      "updated": 1791217365960,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*id                    bigint PK\n*company_id            bigint\n*actor_type            smallint chatbot_user/admin/\n                       operator/system\n*actor_id              bigint null\n*entity_type           text (conversation, turn,\n                       change_request, chatbot_config,\n                       company_secret, eval_run…)\n*entity_id             bigint null (for joins)\n*entity_action         text (started, approved, verified,\n                       published, added, destroyed…)\n*entity_version        int null (config / tool version)\n*parent_log_id         bigint null (immediate parent)\n*root_log_id           bigint null (NULL = this is the root;\n                       conversation / eval run / workflow)\n*detail                jsonb (ids and reasons, never values)\n*created_at            timestamptz NN\n*append-only · partitioned by month · no FKs\n*critical events: + event_outbox row in the same txn\n*low-stakes telemetry via waitUntil\n*PK (id, created_at): the partition key must be in the PK\n*partitions y2026m10 … y2027m12 + activity_log_default",
      "originalText": "*id                    bigint PK\n*company_id            bigint\n*actor_type            smallint chatbot_user/admin/\n                       operator/system\n*actor_id              bigint null\n*entity_type           text (conversation, turn,\n                       change_request, chatbot_config,\n                       company_secret, eval_run…)\n*entity_id             bigint null (for joins)\n*entity_action         text (started, approved, verified,\n                       published, added, destroyed…)\n*entity_version        int null (config / tool version)\n*parent_log_id         bigint null (immediate parent)\n*root_log_id           bigint null (NULL = this is the root;\n                       conversation / eval run / workflow)\n*detail                jsonb (ids and reasons, never values)\n*created_at            timestamptz NN\n*append-only · partitioned by month · no FKs\n*critical events: + event_outbox row in the same txn\n*low-stakes telemetry via waitUntil\n*PK (id, created_at): the partition key must be in the PK\n*partitions y2026m10 … y2027m12 + activity_log_default",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
