      "text": "company_id              bigint\n*chatbot_id            bigint → chatbots null\n                       (null = company-wide)\nday                    date\nmetric                 text\nvalue                  numeric\n*id                    bigint PK (internal)\n*UQ (company_id, chatbot_id, day, metric)\n   NULLS NOT DISTINCT\nrebuilt hourly by Cron · derived, never a source of truth\n*idempotent: any (company, day) re-runnable",
