      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Table rename: config_versions → chatbot_configs · version_no → config_version · gate_eval_run_id → approved_by_run_id\n• companies.active_config_id removed: status = published is the only source of truth · UQ (company_id) WHERE status = published\n  publish = one transaction: old published → archived, then new → published (the unique index blocks a second live config)\n• chatbot_configs: body editable only while draft (Repo layer) · rollback = copy old body into a new draft → gate eval → publish\n  schema_version = which Zod spec in code parses body (bump only on a breaking body-shape change; upgrade old rows on read)\n• FK renames: conversations.config_version_id + eval_runs.config_version_id → chatbot_config_id\n• company_connections: jwks_url + jwt_audience dropped · JWKS derived from issuer ({iss}/.well-known/jwks.json)\n  aud = platform constant · jwt_issuer NN UQ = lookup key (token iss → row) · base_url null only for host_exec · allowed_origins NN\n• Actor naming rule: <verb>_by → admins.id (null = system; operator is an admin), paired with <verb>_at\n  created_by_admin_id → created_by (company_secrets, roi_assumptions, chatbot_configs) · flagged_by_admin_id → created_by (quality_issues)\n  updated_by added: companies · company_secrets · company_connections · tool_definitions · knowledge_sources · chatbot_configs\n  created_by added: company_connections · tool_definitions · knowledge_sources\n  published_by added: chatbot_configs · tool_definitions gets updated_at\n• change_requests: requested_by_chatbot_user_id + decided_by_chatbot_user_id dropped (= conversations.chatbot_user_id;\n  approval happens in that user's widget) · decided_at kept\n• tools → tool_definitions · write_op → call_op (every tool, reads too) · diff_fields dropped → readback_op.compare\n  readback_op null for read tools (CHECK risk = read ⇔ readback_op IS NULL)\n  placeholders {args.*} {before.*} {result.*} · compare keys = arg names (expected = args[key])\n• eval_runs slimmed: runner + model trigger dropped · passes_gate → has_passed\n  (every run gets a verdict; gate = trigger gate AND has_passed)\n  pass threshold + judge model pinned in harness code (harness_version) · status 1 queued 2 running 3 done 4 failed\n• Judge: LLM judge calls go through AI Gateway on the company's key, logged in model_calls as task_type eval.judge\n  eval_runs.cost_usd = bot + judge calls (split by task_type)\n• roi_assumptions.hourly_cost_usd dropped: v1 reports hours saved only\n• quality_issues = triage inbox: source 1 user 2 admin 3 system · status 1 open 2 dismissed 3 converted 4 fixed\n  feedback_id (user thumbs-down → issue) · issue_type null until triage · updated_by/updated_at\n  CHECKs tie source to feedback_id / created_by\n• eval_cases: origin + origin_conversation_id dropped (company_id null = platform; issue → case link on quality_issues.eval_case_id)\n  convert from issue = PII-free rewrite, admin confirms · conversations.flagged dropped (open issue = flagged)\n• Boolean rule: every bool has an is_ / has_ / was_ prefix · read_only → is_read_only · passed → has_passed (eval_runs, eval_results)\n  active → is_active · untrusted_context → has_untrusted_context · escalated → was_escalated\n• Safety cases (eval_cases.is_safety): any failure fails the run (hard gate, even above threshold)\n  platform safety cases can't be deactivated · safety results shown separately · rule pinned by harness_version\n• Model spend completeness: embed + rerank calls go via AI Gateway and write model_calls rows too\n  task_type knowledge.embed · search.embed · search.rerank · doc_gap.embed · tier 4 embed\n  both conversation_id + eval_run_id null = background job · eval_results.cost_usd dropped (run-level cost only)\n• conversations.cost_usd dropped: derive SUM(model_calls.cost_usd) by conversation_id (live caps use DO counters)\n• change_requests slimmed (31 → 22): tool_id, tool_version, risk, idempotency_mode dropped (via tool_call_id → tool_calls)\n  decided_at / committed_at / verified_at / undone_at dropped (timeline in activity_log) · values_purged_at dropped\n  (purged = encrypted_changes IS NULL) · tool_calls.tool_name → tool_id + tool_version\n• knowledge_sources: team_answers type dropped · uri → url (web only) · schedule (cron) → sync_frequency 1 manual 2 daily 3 weekly\n  page_count dropped (COUNT files) · status values written out · tool_calls.risk dropped (via tool_id + tool_version)\n• knowledge_documents split out of files (28 tables): knowledge_source_id, file_id, title, source_url, content_hash,\n  index_status, last_synced_at · knowledge_chunks.file_id → knowledge_document_id · answered_by_file_id → answered_by_document_id\n  files: purpose (derived from owner_type), r2_key (fixed pattern), created_by_type/_id (→ created_by), cite_count dropped\n• eval_cases.embedding dropped (dedupe not needed in v1; backfill later if added back)\n• Multi-bot: chatbots table (is_default; widget loads the default) · chatbot_id on chatbot_configs (one published per bot),\n  conversations, eval_cases (NN except platform), model_calls, activity_rollups · knowledge, tools, budget stay company-level\n• event_outbox: written in the same transaction as the change · relay → Queue · 1 pending 2 published 3 failed\n  activity_log.dedupe_key + its UQ moved to event_outbox (fixes the partitioned-UQ problem)\n• turn_id (ULID from the Conversation DO) on messages, tool_calls, model_calls · model_calls.chatbot_user_id\n• No platform model keys: model_calls.key_source dropped · judge + evals on the company's key · key failure →\n  'temporarily unavailable' + system quality_issue · Workers AI embed/rerank (tier 4) = the only platform cost · BudgetDO\n• Evals on the company's staging connection: platform-signed eval JWT (/eval/* only) · readback asserts · state-independent\n  cases · company_connections.reset_op · mock host removed · nightly = platform suite on our test company + daily prod health\n• agent_change_requests → change_requests · conversations.channel dropped · knowledge_chunks: + knowledge_source_id,\n  − token_count · halfvec for doc_gaps + clusters · doc_gaps refs nulled on purge · UQs on 1:1 refs · converted CHECK\n• Silent host-token refresh (token_needed → widget) · JWT as first WS message · RLS ctx per transaction · Hyperdrive cache off\n  · AI Gateway + Logpush short retention · crypto-shred = encrypted_* only · can(admin, action, resource) · config refresh next turn\n• Unchanged: files.created_by_type/_id and activity_log.actor_* stay polymorphic",
      "originalText": "• Table rename: config_versions → chatbot_configs · version_no → config_version · gate_eval_run_id → approved_by_run_id\n• companies.active_config_id removed: status = published is the only source of truth · UQ (company_id) WHERE status = published\n  publish = one transaction: old published → archived, then new → published (the unique index blocks a second live config)\n• chatbot_configs: body editable only while draft (Repo layer) · rollback = copy old body into a new draft → gate eval → publish\n  schema_version = which Zod spec in code parses body (bump only on a breaking body-shape change; upgrade old rows on read)\n• FK renames: conversations.config_version_id + eval_runs.config_version_id → chatbot_config_id\n• company_connections: jwks_url + jwt_audience dropped · JWKS derived from issuer ({iss}/.well-known/jwks.json)\n  aud = platform constant · jwt_issuer NN UQ = lookup key (token iss → row) · base_url null only for host_exec · allowed_origins NN\n• Actor naming rule: <verb>_by → admins.id (null = system; operator is an admin), paired with <verb>_at\n  created_by_admin_id → created_by (company_secrets, roi_assumptions, chatbot_configs) · flagged_by_admin_id → created_by (quality_issues)\n  updated_by added: companies · company_secrets · company_connections · tool_definitions · knowledge_sources · chatbot_configs\n  created_by added: company_connections · tool_definitions · knowledge_sources\n  published_by added: chatbot_configs · tool_definitions gets updated_at\n• change_requests: requested_by_chatbot_user_id + decided_by_chatbot_user_id dropped (= conversations.chatbot_user_id;\n  approval happens in that user's widget) · decided_at kept\n• tools → tool_definitions · write_op → call_op (every tool, reads too) · diff_fields dropped → readback_op.compare\n  readback_op null for read tools (CHECK risk = read ⇔ readback_op IS NULL)\n  placeholders {args.*} {before.*} {result.*} · compare keys = arg names (expected = args[key])\n• eval_runs slimmed: runner + model trigger dropped · passes_gate → has_passed\n  (every run gets a verdict; gate = trigger gate AND has_passed)\n  pass threshold + judge model pinned in harness code (harness_version) · status 1 queued 2 running 3 done 4 failed\n• Judge: LLM judge calls go through AI Gateway on the company's key, logged in model_calls as task_type eval.judge\n  eval_runs.cost_usd = bot + judge calls (split by task_type)\n• roi_assumptions.hourly_cost_usd dropped: v1 reports hours saved only\n• quality_issues = triage inbox: source 1 user 2 admin 3 system · status 1 open 2 dismissed 3 converted 4 fixed\n  feedback_id (user thumbs-down → issue) · issue_type null until triage · updated_by/updated_at\n  CHECKs tie source to feedback_id / created_by\n• eval_cases: origin + origin_conversation_id dropped (company_id null = platform; issue → case link on quality_issues.eval_case_id)\n  convert from issue = PII-free rewrite, admin confirms · conversations.flagged dropped (open issue = flagged)\n• Boolean rule: every bool has an is_ / has_ / was_ prefix · read_only → is_read_only · passed → has_passed (eval_runs, eval_results)\n  active → is_active · untrusted_context → has_untrusted_context · escalated → was_escalated\n• Safety cases (eval_cases.is_safety): any failure fails the run (hard gate, even above threshold)\n  platform safety cases can't be deactivated · safety results shown separately · rule pinned by harness_version\n• Model spend completeness: embed + rerank calls go via AI Gateway and write model_calls rows too\n  task_type knowledge.embed · search.embed · search.rerank · doc_gap.embed · tier 4 embed\n  both conversation_id + eval_run_id null = background job · eval_results.cost_usd dropped (run-level cost only)\n• conversations.cost_usd dropped: derive SUM(model_calls.cost_usd) by conversation_id (live caps use DO counters)\n• change_requests slimmed (31 → 22): tool_id, tool_version, risk, idempotency_mode dropped (via tool_call_id → tool_calls)\n  decided_at / committed_at / verified_at / undone_at dropped (timeline in activity_log) · values_purged_at dropped\n  (purged = encrypted_changes IS NULL) · tool_calls.tool_name → tool_id + tool_version\n• knowledge_sources: team_answers type dropped · uri → url (web only) · schedule (cron) → sync_frequency 1 manual 2 daily 3 weekly\n  page_count dropped (COUNT files) · status values written out · tool_calls.risk dropped (via tool_id + tool_version)\n• knowledge_documents split out of files (28 tables): knowledge_source_id, file_id, title, source_url, content_hash,\n  index_status, last_synced_at · knowledge_chunks.file_id → knowledge_document_id · answered_by_file_id → answered_by_document_id\n  files: purpose (derived from owner_type), r2_key (fixed pattern), created_by_type/_id (→ created_by), cite_count dropped\n• eval_cases.embedding dropped (dedupe not needed in v1; backfill later if added back)\n• Multi-bot: chatbots table (is_default; widget loads the default) · chatbot_id on chatbot_configs (one published per bot),\n  conversations, eval_cases (NN except platform), model_calls, activity_rollups · knowledge, tools, budget stay company-level\n• event_outbox: written in the same transaction as the change · relay → Queue · 1 pending 2 published 3 failed\n  activity_log.dedupe_key + its UQ moved to event_outbox (fixes the partitioned-UQ problem)\n• turn_id (ULID from the Conversation DO) on messages, tool_calls, model_calls · model_calls.chatbot_user_id\n• No platform model keys: model_calls.key_source dropped · judge + evals on the company's key · key failure →\n  'temporarily unavailable' + system quality_issue · Workers AI embed/rerank (tier 4) = the only platform cost · BudgetDO\n• Evals on the company's staging connection: platform-signed eval JWT (/eval/* only) · readback asserts · state-independent\n  cases · company_connections.reset_op · mock host removed · nightly = platform suite on our test company + daily prod health\n• agent_change_requests → change_requests · conversations.channel dropped · knowledge_chunks: + knowledge_source_id,\n  − token_count · halfvec for doc_gaps + clusters · doc_gaps refs nulled on purge · UQs on 1:1 refs · converted CHECK\n• Silent host-token refresh (token_needed → widget) · JWT as first WS message · RLS ctx per transaction · Hyperdrive cache off\n  · AI Gateway + Logpush short retention · crypto-shred = encrypted_* only · can(admin, action, resource) · config refresh next turn\n• Unchanged: files.created_by_type/_id and activity_log.actor_* stay polymorphic",
