    },
    {
      "id": "tex-todob",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1179.0112000000001,
      "y": 2244,
      "width": 859.0400000000001,
      "height": 350.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 967752350,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 1499570886,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1  DONE: dedupe moved to event_outbox UQ (company_id, dedupe_key)\n2  OPEN: Workflows for large commits must not persist the host token: each step asks the DO (→ widget) for a fresh one\n3  DONE: widget closed → needs_human, resumes when the widget reconnects\n4  DONE: accepted with short retention (content_retention_days · gateway logs ≤ 7 days)\n5  DONE: crypto-shred claim reworded: encrypted_* columns only\n6  DONE: set_config(…, true) per transaction · Hyperdrive query cache off · company_id in every WHERE\n7  OPEN: JWT verify: pin algorithms (RS256 / ES256), reject none and HS*\n8  DONE: BudgetDO per company (reserve before / settle after each model call)\n9  DONE: company's staging connection · platform-signed eval JWT · company key pays (judge too)\n10 DONE: silent token refresh (token_needed → widget) covers approve and undo\n11 DONE: conversations.channel dropped (widget is the only channel)\n12 DONE: config refreshed at the next turn\n13 DONE: event_outbox in the same transaction → relay → Queue\n14 DONE: header reworded: admins + platform eval_cases have their own policies\n15 DONE in v0.15: tool_calls.tool_name → tool_id + tool_version\n16 DONE: UQs added on all 1:1 refs\n17 DONE: nullable, nulled on purge\n18 DONE: halfvec everywhere\n19 DONE: turn_id on messages / tool_calls / model_calls · model_calls.chatbot_user_id\n20 DONE: 'chatbot' everywhere · agent_change_requests → change_requests",
      "originalText": "1  DONE: dedupe moved to event_outbox UQ (company_id, dedupe_key)\n2  OPEN: Workflows for large commits must not persist the host token: each step asks the DO (→ widget) for a fresh one\n3  DONE: widget closed → needs_human, resumes when the widget reconnects\n4  DONE: accepted with short retention (content_retention_days · gateway logs ≤ 7 days)\n5  DONE: crypto-shred claim reworded: encrypted_* columns only\n6  DONE: set_config(…, true) per transaction · Hyperdrive query cache off · company_id in every WHERE\n7  OPEN: JWT verify: pin algorithms (RS256 / ES256), reject none and HS*\n8  DONE: BudgetDO per company (reserve before / settle after each model call)\n9  DONE: company's staging connection · platform-signed eval JWT · company key pays (judge too)\n10 DONE: silent token refresh (token_needed → widget) covers approve and undo\n11 DONE: conversations.channel dropped (widget is the only channel)\n12 DONE: config refreshed at the next turn\n13 DONE: event_outbox in the same transaction → relay → Queue\n14 DONE: header reworded: admins + platform eval_cases have their own policies\n15 DONE in v0.15: tool_calls.tool_name → tool_id + tool_version\n16 DONE: UQs added on all 1:1 refs\n17 DONE: nullable, nulled on purge\n18 DONE: halfvec everywhere\n19 DONE: turn_id on messages / tool_calls / model_calls · model_calls.chatbot_user_id\n20 DONE: 'chatbot' everywhere · agent_change_requests → change_requests",
