      "text": "*id                    bigint PK\n*public_id             text UQ\n*company_id            bigint → companies\n*knowledge_source_id   bigint NN → knowledge_sources\n*file_id               bigint NN → files UQ\n*title                 text (shown in citations)\n*source_url            text null (page URL, web sources)\n*content_hash          text (extracted text; skip\n                       unchanged on re-sync)\n*index_status          smallint NN 1 pending 2 indexed\n                       3 failed\n*last_synced_at        timestamptz null\n*created_at            timestamptz NN\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN\n*sha256 (files) = bytes · content_hash = text\n*UQ (knowledge_source_id, source_url) if source_url\n*delete source → its documents → their files\n*(split out of files in v0.15)",
      "originalText": "*id                    bigint PK\n*public_id             text UQ\n*company_id            bigint → companies\n*knowledge_source_id   bigint NN → knowledge_sources\n*file_id               bigint NN → files UQ\n*title                 text (shown in citations)\n*source_url            text null (page URL, web sources)\n*content_hash          text (extracted text; skip\n                       unchanged on re-sync)\n*index_status          smallint NN 1 pending 2 indexed\n                       3 failed\n*last_synced_at        timestamptz null\n*created_at            timestamptz NN\n*updated_at            timestamptz NN\n*sha256 (files) = bytes · content_hash = text\n*UQ (knowledge_source_id, source_url) if source_url\n*delete source → its documents → their files\n*(split out of files in v0.15)",
