      "text": "*id                    bigint PK\n*company_id            bigint → companies\n*activity_log_id       bigint → activity_log\n*event_type            text\n*dedupe_key            text\n*status                smallint NN 1 pending 2 published\n                       3 failed\n*attempts              smallint NN default 0\n*last_error            text null\n*created_at            timestamptz NN\n*published_at          timestamptz null\n*UQ (company_id, dedupe_key)\n*same transaction as the change + its activity_log row\n*relay: publish after commit (waitUntil) + Cron sweep\n*  of pending > 1 min · failed after N attempts → alert\n*published = handed to the Queue; consumers track their\n*  own deliveries · published rows purged after a few days",
      "originalText": "*id                    bigint PK\n*company_id            bigint → companies\n*activity_log_id       bigint → activity_log\n*event_type            text\n*dedupe_key            text\n*status                smallint NN 1 pending 2 published\n                       3 failed\n*attempts              smallint NN default 0\n*last_error            text null\n*created_at            timestamptz NN\n*published_at          timestamptz null\n*UQ (company_id, dedupe_key)\n*same transaction as the change + its activity_log row\n*relay: publish after commit (waitUntil) + Cron sweep\n*  of pending > 1 min · failed after N attempts → alert\n*published = handed to the Queue; consumers track their\n*  own deliveries · published rows purged after a few days",
