      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What changed in M1-1 (migrations)",
      "originalText": "What changed in M1-1 (migrations)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "tex-m11b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1179.0112000000001,
      "y": 2694,
      "width": 831.6,
      "height": 332.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1642341943,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 164781171,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791263331162,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• public_id (text UQ) + updated_at (timestamptz NN) on every table, except append-only / derived:\n  activity_log · event_outbox · activity_rollups · eval_results · knowledge_chunks\n  admins (clerk_user_id) and chatbot_users (host_user_id) keep their own client id\n• activity_rollups gets an internal id PK\n• activity_log partitioned by month on created_at · PK (id, created_at)\n  partitions 2026-10 … 2027-12 + default · add months ahead (rows in default block a new partition)\n• company_encryption_keys.encrypted_key nullable: nulled on destroy (crypto-shred)\n• company_connections: environment 1 production 2 staging · status 1 active 2 disabled\n• eval_results: UQ (eval_run_id, eval_case_id, attempt) = one row per attempt\n• CHECKs from card notes made explicit: company_connections base_url (host_exec only may be null)\n  eval_cases (company_id IS NULL) = (chatbot_id IS NULL) · platform safety cases stay is_active\n• partial indexes for jobs: change_requests (undo_until) WHERE encrypted_changes IS NOT NULL\n  event_outbox (created_at) WHERE status = pending\n• knowledge_chunks.tsv = heading (weight A) + text (weight B), english config · GIN\n• halfvec + HNSW declared in tables.ts (drizzle-orm rc.4); partitions in a custom SQL migration\n• names: UNQ_<table>_<cols> · IDX_<table>_<cols> · CHK_<table>_<rule>\n• every migration has a down.sql · pnpm --filter backend db:rollback [n]\n• M1-3 RLS: worker connects as diletta_app (no BYPASSRLS) · RLS forced on tenant tables + companies\n  tenant + platform policy · withPlatform for operator, cross-company jobs, pre-tenant lookups",
      "originalText": "• public_id (text UQ) + updated_at (timestamptz NN) on every table, except append-only / derived:\n  activity_log · event_outbox · activity_rollups · eval_results · knowledge_chunks\n  admins (clerk_user_id) and chatbot_users (host_user_id) keep their own client id\n• activity_rollups gets an internal id PK\n• activity_log partitioned by month on created_at · PK (id, created_at)\n  partitions 2026-10 … 2027-12 + default · add months ahead (rows in default block a new partition)\n• company_encryption_keys.encrypted_key nullable: nulled on destroy (crypto-shred)\n• company_connections: environment 1 production 2 staging · status 1 active 2 disabled\n• eval_results: UQ (eval_run_id, eval_case_id, attempt) = one row per attempt\n• CHECKs from card notes made explicit: company_connections base_url (host_exec only may be null)\n  eval_cases (company_id IS NULL) = (chatbot_id IS NULL) · platform safety cases stay is_active\n• partial indexes for jobs: change_requests (undo_until) WHERE encrypted_changes IS NOT NULL\n  event_outbox (created_at) WHERE status = pending\n• knowledge_chunks.tsv = heading (weight A) + text (weight B), english config · GIN\n• halfvec + HNSW declared in tables.ts (drizzle-orm rc.4); partitions in a custom SQL migration\n• names: UNQ_<table>_<cols> · IDX_<table>_<cols> · CHK_<table>_<rule>\n• every migration has a down.sql · pnpm --filter backend db:rollback [n]\n• M1-3 RLS: worker connects as diletta_app (no BYPASSRLS) · RLS forced on tenant tables + companies\n  tenant + platform policy · withPlatform for operator, cross-company jobs, pre-tenant lookups",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
